# The Tauri desktop shell's Rust build output — multi-GB of compiled
# artifacts, entirely irrelevant to the Vercel web deployment. This is
# already covered by src-tauri/.gitignore, but Vercel's own upload
# scanner doesn't appear to honor nested .gitignore files, so it needs
# to be listed explicitly here too (this caused a "File size limit
# exceeded (100 MB)" deploy failure after uploading ~2.9GB).
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/gen
